{"id":"e7523d1f0e830eb6","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-K-minimal-pair.md","title":"存在非平凡初段K度的极小对","display":"thm-K-minimal-pair — 存在非平凡初段K度的极小对","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-K-minimal-pair","aliases":["43-thm-K-minimal-pair"],"display":"thm-K-minimal-pair — 存在非平凡初段K度的极小对","depends_on":["[[43-df-complexity-red]]","[[43-df-ktrivial]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Corollary 15.9.2; printed p.478 / PDF p.498","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-K-minimal-pair"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-K-minimal-pair</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-K-minimal-pair — 存在非平凡初段K度的极小对"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9d68ed64bfec741d\" href=\"?note=9d68ed64bfec741d\" title=\"43-df-complexity-red\">43-df-complexity-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ccd45302acc926e6\" href=\"?note=ccd45302acc926e6\" title=\"43-df-ktrivial\">43-df-ktrivial</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Corollary 15.9.2; printed p.478 / PDF p.498"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_K\">\\(\\le_K\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KTrivial}\">\\(\\mathrm{KTrivial}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9d68ed64bfec741d\" href=\"?note=9d68ed64bfec741d\" title=\"43-df-complexity-red\">43-df-complexity-red</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ccd45302acc926e6\" href=\"?note=ccd45302acc926e6\" title=\"43-df-ktrivial\">43-df-ktrivial</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(A,B,X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists A,B\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\neg\\mathrm{KTrivial}(A)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{KTrivial}(B)\\land\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\bigl(X\\le_KA\\land X\\le_KB\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{KTrivial}(X)\\bigr)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists A,B\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\neg\\mathrm{KTrivial}(A)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{KTrivial}(B)\\land\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\bigl(X\\le_KA\\land X\\le_KB\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{KTrivial}(X)\\bigr)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两个下锥的公共部分正好是最小K度；“非K平凡”前提排除平凡见证。来源交替使一方暂时高复杂、另一方补零，用上一条gap函数控制公共下界；本条未声称A、B为Δ⁰₂或左c.e.。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的2007-07-28草稿，Corollary 15.9.2; printed p.478 / PDF p.498。本轮逐项比对来源陈述并人工核对类型、参数和去Remark条件；未声称机器形式验证或来源完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-complexity-red","status":"resolved","id":"9d68ed64bfec741d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-complexity-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ktrivial","status":"resolved","id":"ccd45302acc926e6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ktrivial]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-complexity-red","status":"resolved","id":"9d68ed64bfec741d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\le_K$ 与 $\\mathrm{KTrivial}$ 见 [[43-df-complexity-red]]、[[43-df-ktrivial]]；$A,B,X\\in2^\\omega$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ktrivial","status":"resolved","id":"ccd45302acc926e6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\le_K$ 与 $\\mathrm{KTrivial}$ 见 [[43-df-complexity-red]]、[[43-df-ktrivial]]；$A,B,X\\in2^\\omega$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\le_K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KTrivial}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B,X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists A,B\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\neg\\mathrm{KTrivial}(A)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{KTrivial}(B)\\land\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\bigl(X\\le_KA\\land X\\le_KB\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{KTrivial}(X)\\bigr)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1493,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-403","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-K-minimal-pair]] — 存在非平凡初段K度的极小对"}],"outgoing":["9d68ed64bfec741d","ccd45302acc926e6"]}